flowchart TD
    A([selectDamagePhotoPages\ncalled]) --> B[extractImageFeatures\nfor each image:\nmeanBrightness, colourVariance\nblurScore, edgeDensity\naspectRatio]

    B --> C[scoreDamageLikelihood\nweighted heuristic score\nper image features]

    C --> D{Classification\ndecision}
    D -- score >= DAMAGE_THRESHOLD --> E[classified as damage]
    D -- score >= AMBIGUOUS_THRESHOLD --> F{Night-photo\nrescue check?\nmeanBrightness less than 80\nAND colourVariance greater than 0.05}
    D -- score below AMBIGUOUS_THRESHOLD --> G[classified as document\nor non-damage]

    F -- Yes --> H[push to LLM\nambiguous pool\nnight-photo rescue path\nR-B-03b]
    F -- No --> I[push to LLM\nambiguous pool\nnormal ambiguous]

    E --> J[confirmed damage pool]
    H --> K[LLM batch classifier\nambiguous pool only\nGPT-4o vision\nbatch up to LLM_BATCH_SIZE]
    I --> K

    K --> L[merge LLM results\nwith heuristic confirmed pool]

    L --> M[perceptualDedup\nhash-based deduplication\nHamming distance less than DEDUP_THRESHOLD]

    M --> N[rank by damage score\nreturn top N pages]

    G --> O[excluded from result]

    N --> P([return selected\ndamage photo pages])

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style P fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style H fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
